\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Ingestion data flow: three source pipelines converging at shared JSONL files, then diverging into system-specific indexes. Chunking parameters (400-word sliding window, 60-word overlap) and the BGE-base-en-v1.5 embedding model are shared across both systems; the sole architectural difference is a single unified index for RAG versus three per-source indexes for the agent.}}{24}{figure.3.1}%
